                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "lefties"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "915f833c-82d6-337b-8d23-547372695bc1",
                        "entry_id": "1dc2417d-c8e2-3e67-974b-8152b47cd59b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who is left-handed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Canada",
                            "US",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f0212d18-5e68-3dbe-9c3d-d9dba76bb185",
                        "entry_id": "1dc2417d-c8e2-3e67-974b-8152b47cd59b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who has left-wing political views."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d51eb31b-d9a4-41fc-8b77-a9b9141b83e1",
                                "sense_id": "f0212d18-5e68-3dbe-9c3d-d9dba76bb185",
                                "text": "The new brocialism cares deeply about women’s issues of course – just not enough to elect an actual woman. They don’t need to, because good lefties speak for all us. They don’t even notice gender."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1cac0ad5-249c-358a-baf6-afa612b01610",
                        "entry_id": "1dc2417d-c8e2-3e67-974b-8152b47cd59b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One's left testicle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc0d4936-db8a-45e0-a422-e7dcc9a89478",
                                "sense_id": "1cac0ad5-249c-358a-baf6-afa612b01610",
                                "text": "I'll bet my lefty he won't show up for work today."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8c9e191e-5a90-3a30-8392-c1291316983b",
                        "entry_id": "1dc2417d-c8e2-3e67-974b-8152b47cd59b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One's left hand."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Multicultural-London-English",
                            "slang",
                            "uncommon"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee2ae398-758c-49b3-ad66-bccd531f02f4",
                                "sense_id": "8c9e191e-5a90-3a30-8392-c1291316983b",
                                "text": "This pole gets whipped, I miss dishing it, putting red on the can like Pepsi\nGovs said I defy, I never been right but my yank does love my lefty"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d92d221-2d5b-4b47-9d3c-436fade55be7",
                                "sense_id": "8c9e191e-5a90-3a30-8392-c1291316983b",
                                "text": "Spin that whip, let me see that dog, Imma blam that goal like Messi, shit gets messy – and I still get him down with my lefty"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "df947401-a915-4561-bc66-74de284bf688",
                        "source_entry_id": "1dc2417d-c8e2-3e67-974b-8152b47cd59b",
                        "source_sense_description": "one who has left-wing political views",
                        "target_lang_word": "gaucho",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gaucho",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1cf81bf-bc1c-35a3-b2e9-3c10ad8761a7",
                                        "entry_id": "27e33068-a232-3201-9c68-9548e978af1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gardien de troupeau d’Amérique du Sud."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Hispanisme"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3be10fac-5a13-4cfc-9c8b-79f54214dc3d",
                                                "sense_id": "c1cf81bf-bc1c-35a3-b2e9-3c10ad8761a7",
                                                "text": "C’est mon avis, dit le major, car, si je ne me trompe, loin d’être inoffensifs, les Gauchos sont, au contraire, de francs et redoutables bandits."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e986248d-2feb-43a5-80d1-265f64318fb3",
                                                "sense_id": "c1cf81bf-bc1c-35a3-b2e9-3c10ad8761a7",
                                                "text": "C'est ainsi que je fus conduit à raconter qu'ayant été trois jours égaré dans ces plaines sans fin, n'ayant pas de vivres ni d'eau, j'avais été réduit à faire comme les gauchos qui m'accompagnaient, c'est-à-dire à saigner mon cheval et à boire son sang."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "gaucho",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4252d951-c803-3dd1-9c1a-fe46bc9dfbe3",
                                        "entry_id": "f07ee346-e7c9-3b74-92f0-11a5de331bc6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gauchiste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ca29944-ad54-412b-813b-b99e6101df76",
                                                "sense_id": "4252d951-c803-3dd1-9c1a-fe46bc9dfbe3",
                                                "text": "Par contre, son frère, à la fac, était un gaucho notoire, connu pour avoir rarement raté une manif et volontiers bouffé du flic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "36a1ebb4-384e-42fa-8965-f6301adc6e03",
                        "source_entry_id": "1dc2417d-c8e2-3e67-974b-8152b47cd59b",
